abstract: >-
  Exact certificate data and Python code for the computer-assisted estimates
  in Exact complex coherence in codimension two, for the sufficient threshold
  N >= 180. The manuscript supplies the analytic reductions, extension to all
  N >= 180, and classification of equality cases.
keywords:
  - coherence
  - complex projective codes
  - exact arithmetic
  - computer-assisted proofs
